  <li><a href="/guides/state-certified-lab-vs-mail-in-kit-vs-test-strips/">State-certified lab vs mail-in kit vs test strips</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>What we do and don't do</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Every listing links to the government list it came from and shows that list's own date plus the date we checked it.</li>
  <li>We do not rate or rank labs, and we do not test water.</li>
  <li>We have no affiliate links today. If we add any, they will be marked. See the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</li>
</ul>
